 # Public agent guide for AsyncBEV
 
+## Local parking-bev deployment adaptation
+
+This checkout has a local patch: CmtHead.temporal_bev_warping reads ground-truth
+flow and runs its supervision-only FlowEmbedder only during training. Evaluation
+keeps learned velocity estimation, delta-time multiplication and ego-motion
+alignment unchanged; its unused GT-flow diagnostic output is zero. Model state
+dict keys are unchanged. A separate parking-bev worker supplies raw sensor arrays
+and calibration metadata instead of the benchmark's map/flow file loaders.
+Validate this adaptation separately from official benchmark reproduction.
+
 Use this guide when reading, explaining, or changing this repository. Start with the [README](README.md) for installation, data preparation, available assets, and training/evaluation commands.
 
 `AGENTS_public.md` is an explicit public guide, not a universally auto-discovered filename. When starting an AI coding assistant on a fresh clone, ask it to **read `AGENTS_public.md` before working**, or configure the assistant to load it. All paths below are relative to the repository root.
